This package is based on `@deepseek-ai/dsh-storage-json` from the DeepSeek
Harness repository at commit
`477b4f420553e8a52c2fbccc464d7561b239c443`, under the MIT License. The exact
upstream license is included in `LICENSE.upstream`.

NextTavern's maintained delta changes relative ESM import specifiers to `.js`
and serializes the per-record file-read and per-table `loadAll()` fan-outs. It
does not change the storage API, persistence format, configured limits, prompt,
or model request behavior. Cold-load serialization applies within this
backend call; it is not a process-wide concurrency limit. Host activation stays
manual-only after package delivery.
